msgid "Disconnect the camera."
msgstr "Odłącz kamerę."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/recovery.rst:29
msgid "Connect a jumper wire between the **BOOT** and **RST** pins."
msgstr "Połącz zworką piny **BOOT** i **RST**\\ ."

