#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/recovery.rst:40
msgid "OpenMV Cam N6 (BOOT--VCC jumper)"
msgstr "OpenMV Cam N6 (zworka BOOT--VCC)"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/recovery.rst:43
msgid "Connect a jumper wire between the **BOOT** and **VCC** pins."
msgstr "Połącz zworką piny **BOOT** i **VCC**\\ ."

